OL,3,GNEWSACity's art trail benches 'bring
OL,4,Apeople together'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty painted "book bench" sculptures
OL,7,Fhave been placed across Brighton as
OL,8,Fpart of a charity art trail.
OL,10,FThe sculpture trail is designed as a
OL,11,Fwalking route through the city from
OL,12,FSaturday until 8 November.
OL,14,FAs well as the painted book bench
OL,15,Fsculptures, schools and community
OL,16,Fgroups have also designed an additional
OL,17,F40 mini book benches.
OL,19,FThe trail will be raising money for
OL,20,FAmaze, a Sussex charity which supports
OL,21,Ffamilies with disabled children.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
